{"data": [{"author_id": "1233761554442571776", "created_at": "2026-11-12T07:13:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120776924666663341"], "id": "2120776924666663341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1068, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股重大事件\n\n11.12-11.16\n\n11月12日（星期四）\n国内社融、信贷数据发布\n影响板块：大金融、地产、基建\n相关龙头：招商、宁波、万k A、保利发展、中国建筑\n\n全球人工智能产业大会\n影响板块：AI算力、AI应用、服务器\n相关龙头：浪潮信息、中科曙光、鸿博股份、三六零、昆仑万维\n\n11月13日（星期五）", "url": "https://x.com/ss33910/status/2120776924666663341"}, {"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:39:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120572235786150139"], "id": "2120572235786150139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 682, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国大陆央行将加大逆周期调节力度，社融与货币供应增速双双放缓\n\n中国大陆人民银行11月11日发布第三季度货币政策执行报告，重申继续实施适度宽松的货币政策，并表示将加大逆周期调节力度，扩大国内需求，支持经济增长。 https://t.co/Vz6LBpwogt", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2120572235786150139"}, {"author_id": "1906745222404378625", "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:21:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120914809944220136"], "id": "2120914809944220136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120523699979755724", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "PBOC Rate-Cut Reluctance Is Underappreciated\n\nMarket view: The framework shift to overnight repo is broadly interpreted as the beginning of a sustained easing cycle, with LPR cuts expected.\n\nThe gap: The PBOC's Q3 MPR explicitly flagged that loan rates are \"already low\" by global https://t.co/BjlvW7rKlA", "url": "https://x.com/macro_fengshui/status/2120914809944220136"}, {"author_id": "754951184197226496", "created_at": "2026-11-12T03:30:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120720775422611910"], "id": "2120720775422611910", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The People's Bank of China (PBoC) pledged to strengthen counter-cyclical adjustments, boost domestic demand, and improve supply to support sustained, higher-quality economic growth, according to its Q3 monetary policy report. The central bank said it would maintain a flexible,", "url": "https://x.com/megauravgoel/status/2120720775422611910"}, {"author_id": "1749597659902713856", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:09:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120474105183109292"], "id": "2120474105183109292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 168, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人民银行在2026年第三季度货币政策执行报告中提出，推动贷款利率定价基准从比较单一地参考LPR向更加多元基准转型，并指导金融机构探索发放挂钩DR001的浮动利率贷款。", "url": "https://x.com/bytelee_trade/status/2120474105183109292"}, {"author_id": "2073074194112237568", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:45:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120528287671922965"], "id": "2120528287671922965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MACRO &amp; REGULATORY WATCH 11NOV26\n\nThe People's Bank of China released its Q3 2026 Monetary Policy Execution Report, outlining plans to optimize the non-bank large redemption swap facility and shift toward diversified LPR pricing benchmarks. \n\nThe central bank also conducted RMB", "url": "https://x.com/VestigiaLabs/status/2120528287671922965"}, {"author_id": "1516238983000637442", "created_at": "2026-11-12T00:40:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120678105731993810"], "id": "2120678105731993810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 154, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119594056246607932", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "2026-11-12 AI 科技早报\n\n重要动态：\n\n1. 谷歌全